# 构建产物
/quark
/quark.exe
/QuarkLangQkc
/compiler/qkc

# 示例运行产物
out.txt
out2.txt
*.out
# 例外：parity 用例的解释器基线（cgen/parity_test.go 按同名 .out 逐字节比对，缺失即失败），必须入库
!compiler/testdata/cases/*.out

# docs worktree（独立分支，不并入 main）—— 例外见文末
/docs/

# 抗压测试生成物：极端输入、二进制、缓存与运行中间产物（用例由 cmd/qkstress 生成，不入库）
/stress-out/

# 编辑器/系统
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.xmind
lang.test

dist/
dist-ci/
.editors-tmp/
*.test

# Sibling QuarkLang projects, each with its own repository, live directly in this workspace.
# They are not part of this repository and must not be tracked here.
QuarkLangLibs-*/
QuarkLangNpm/
QuarkLangPlayground/
QuarkLangQk*/
QuarkLangQuark/

# Local Go workspace: wires the sibling checkouts above into one build while the parser and this
# repository change together. Per-machine state, never tracked — CI and consumers always build the
# revision pinned in go.mod.
go.work
go.work.sum

# docs/ 整体不并入 main；仅这份接口清单与组合地图例外（见 docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §0）
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.zh-CN.md
